    "owner": "Head of Plant Engineering",
    "description": "Bad twin of edge-iot-glassbox: the data diode is gone and the edge gateway has no egress allow-list; a shadow vibration sensor writes straight to the telemetry lake over unknown transport; PLC traffic is unencrypted; devices lack secure boot / signed updates / SBOM; the lake holds camera PII in West Europe with platform-managed keys, no backup, no geo-redundancy, no RTO/RPO; logs kept 30 days; no incident reporting path (ISG/DORA) and no DR test recorded.",
